7. Issue Voucher (Merchant Payment Already Collected)
Endpoint
POST
/api/v1/wifi/vouchers/issue
Description
Allows merchants to request voucher issuance after collecting customer payment independently.
Request Body
Field
Description
externalReferenceID
Merchant transaction reference
productCode
Voucher product identifier
customer.msisdn
Customer phone number
payment.status
Payment status
payment.reference
Merchant payment reference
payment.amount
Paid amount
payment.currency
Payment currency

Sample Request
{
  "externalReferenceID": "order-test-002",
  "productCode": "WIFI_3H",
  "customer": {
    "msisdn": "+256700000002"
  },
  "payment": {
    "status": "PAID",
    "reference": "PAYMENT_TEST_002",
    "amount": 1000,
    "currency": "UGX"
  }
}
