9. Mark Voucher as Used
Endpoint
POST
/api/v1/wifi/vouchers/mark-used
Description
Updates the voucher status after successful customer usage.
Request Body
{
  "merchantID": "M_TEST_001",
  "voucher": "TEST-WIFI-987654"
}
10. Transaction Lookup
Endpoint
GET
/api/v1/wifi/vouchers/transaction?reference=KCYTEST001WIFI
Description
Retrieves transaction details using the KaCyber transaction reference.
